@name     ksynth_render
@alias    k!
@group    sys
@c_name   skode_clause_ksynth_render
@type     immediate
@arity    0
@match    ()
@summary  evaluate and render KSynth expression
@doc
Evaluates and renders KSynth expression string into audio or wavetable.
Usage: [expression] k!
@code
    return skode_exec_k_bang(ctx, s, args, argc);
@end
